1
00:00:01,181 --> 00:00:09,221
The Princess Sapphire
Knight of the Ribbon

2
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,160
♪ Atashi no miru yume himitsu nano ♪
The dreams I see are my secret

3
00:00:51,250 --> 00:00:57,089
♪ Dare ni mo iwanai himitsu nano ♪
I won’t tell anyone—it’s my secret

4
00:00:58,541 --> 00:01:02,461
♪ Akai manto hira hira ♪
A red cape fluttering

5
00:01:02,462 --> 00:01:04,981
♪ Uma o tobasu oujo ♪
Galloping on a horse—the princess

6
00:01:04,981 --> 00:01:06,901
♪ Sore ga atashi ♪
That’s me!

7
00:01:07,621 --> 00:01:10,901
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

8
00:01:10,905 --> 00:01:13,424
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

9
00:01:14,541 --> 00:01:18,021
♪ Lula-dula-lula-dula ♪
-

10
00:01:18,140 --> 00:01:20,741
♪ Lulu laa, lulaa ♪
-

11
00:01:21,500 --> 00:01:25,220
♪ Ribon no kishi wa ♪
The Knight of the Ribbon,

12
00:01:25,220 --> 00:01:28,621
♪ Honto wa hontto wa ♪
Truly, truly,

13
00:01:28,622 --> 00:01:31,822
♪ Atashi nano sa ♪
It’s really me!

14
00:01:44,101 --> 00:01:50,141
Thirty-Sixth Episode
The Spell of Mephisto
The Great Witch Returns

15
00:02:08,804 --> 00:02:12,893
Hey, where's the roasted lizard?! Hurry up with the bat eye soup!

16
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,380
What's wrong, Hecate? Aren't you eating?

17
00:02:16,715 --> 00:02:18,140
No, I've had enough.

18
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:20,011
No, no, that won't

19
00:02:20,035 --> 00:02:22,938
You'll never become a fine witch like that.

20
00:02:22,962 --> 00:02:24,413
Hey, hurry it up!

21
00:02:26,430 --> 00:02:28,859
Bat eye soup.

22
00:02:29,008 --> 00:02:31,499
Lizard head flambé.

23
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,717
Papa had today's menu specially prepared with

24
00:02:34,742 --> 00:02:36,520
demon nutrition in mind!

25
00:02:36,765 --> 00:02:38,153
Here you go, sir!

26
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:40,451
Here you go.

27
00:02:40,475 --> 00:02:43,811
Come on, Hecate, eat up. Whole roasted lizard builds tenacity,

28
00:02:43,835 --> 00:02:47,380
and bat eye soup fosters cunning.

29
00:02:54,110 --> 00:02:56,000
The fire went out!

30
00:03:02,833 --> 00:03:03,980
What could that be?

31
00:03:05,165 --> 00:03:07,100
It's Mama! Mama's back!

32
00:03:07,600 --> 00:03:11,326
Mama? Did you say Mama? Mama's home?

33
00:03:18,680 --> 00:03:23,660
Home at last after a year. Hecate must surely be a fine witch by now.

34
00:03:23,984 --> 00:03:26,000
Zubarasha!

35
00:03:40,080 --> 00:03:41,999
Ah, I'm home!

36
00:03:42,079 --> 00:03:44,140
Welcome back, Mama.

37
00:03:45,680 --> 00:03:47,380
Mama!

38
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:50,100
Hecate, how have you been?

39
00:03:50,344 --> 00:03:51,746
I was so worried about you,

40
00:03:51,771 --> 00:03:55,300
I thought of nothing else during the entire conference.

41
00:03:55,700 --> 00:04:00,360
And to think that witches' council lasted a whole year. It felt so long.

42
00:04:00,990 --> 00:04:03,993
So, how are your witch studies coming along?

43
00:04:04,630 --> 00:04:06,993
Oh right, did you get that boy's heart put in you yet—

44
00:04:07,017 --> 00:04:10,160
the one from Princess Sapphire your father wrote about?

45
00:04:10,736 --> 00:04:13,539
Once you have a boy's heart, you'll be a magnificent grand witch.

46
00:04:13,563 --> 00:04:16,359
Now, show me some proper grand magic!

47
00:04:16,383 --> 00:04:17,806
Don't be shy. Come on, come on, come on.

48
00:04:17,830 --> 00:04:18,927
Mama, Mama...

49
00:04:19,300 --> 00:04:19,813
What is it?

50
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,373
Well, um... you see... uh...

51
00:04:22,469 --> 00:04:25,780
What are you mumbling about? Speak up!

52
00:04:25,845 --> 00:04:29,053
Uh, Hecate is, well... She's still, um... still, you know... not yet...

53
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:31,606
Not yet? No way...

54
00:04:31,983 --> 00:04:32,826
Hecate...

55
00:04:33,180 --> 00:04:37,866
don't tell me you still haven't become a grand witch. Well, Hecate?

56
00:04:38,746 --> 00:04:41,006
Forgive me, Mama! Forgive me!

57
00:04:41,030 --> 00:04:43,353
I haven't taken back Sapphire's boy heart yet.

58
00:04:43,377 --> 00:04:48,193
You're just a brainless, spineless, pumpkin-headed coward anyway!

59
00:04:48,500 --> 00:04:53,293
What on earth is wrong with you two? What have you been doing all year?

60
00:04:53,318 --> 00:04:57,999
I've done nothing but brag about Hecate to the other witches!

61
00:04:58,310 --> 00:04:59,640
And yet... And yet!

62
00:05:00,900 --> 00:05:02,219
Very well!

63
00:05:03,140 --> 00:05:04,620
I'll do it! Hecate!

64
00:05:05,265 --> 00:05:08,000
Unlike your father, I keep my word. I'm starting right now.

65
00:05:08,180 --> 00:05:10,220
I'm going to turn you into a proper grand witch!

66
00:05:11,890 --> 00:05:15,560
That girl Sapphire who has a boy's heart... She's still at the castle, right?

67
00:05:15,660 --> 00:05:17,720
I think so, Mama. I'll help too.

68
00:05:17,925 --> 00:05:19,299
No, thank you!

69
00:05:25,830 --> 00:05:27,539
What lovely weather...

70
00:05:33,680 --> 00:05:34,780
Forget-me-nots!

71
00:05:36,420 --> 00:05:39,120
What's the flower language for forget-me-nots again?

72
00:05:40,040 --> 00:05:43,280
<i>Let's see, let's see...</i> Oh, right! "Secrets"!

73
00:06:02,993 --> 00:06:05,587
It's a secret! Prince Franz hasn't noticed.

74
00:06:05,611 --> 00:06:10,547
Franz told me, "I love you, flaxen-haired girl."

75
00:06:11,191 --> 00:06:12,760
Secret! Secret!

76
00:06:15,049 --> 00:06:17,934
Mr. Bear, do you know the language of forget-me-nots?

77
00:06:17,958 --> 00:06:21,094
 It means "secret." I have a secret, too.

78
00:06:21,118 --> 00:06:23,347
A wonderful secret nobody knows... That I'm a princess...

79
00:06:23,371 --> 00:06:25,371
Princess...

80
00:06:27,083 --> 00:06:29,685
Who's there? Sneaking this deep into the castle...

81
00:06:30,516 --> 00:06:32,280
This flower's scent...

82
00:06:33,118 --> 00:06:34,625
Who is it? Who's there?

83
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:46,338
Anyone who smells this flower turns into a doll—

84
00:06:46,362 --> 00:06:49,086
a doll that obeys whatever it's told.

85
00:06:49,670 --> 00:06:52,165
Now, stand up, doll.

86
00:06:52,862 --> 00:06:55,900
Go to the Demon Cave. Go on, off you go.

87
00:06:58,200 --> 00:07:01,140
Walk there on your own. To Mephisto's cave.

88
00:07:04,310 --> 00:07:06,820
Carrying you would be easy enough.

89
00:07:07,419 --> 00:07:10,278
But as one revered by my proud witch sisters

90
00:07:10,302 --> 00:07:13,480
as Madame Hell, I do no such thing.

91
00:07:14,125 --> 00:07:17,640
Go on your own. That is Madame Hell's way.

92
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:19,920
Come on now, cheer up, Hecate.

93
00:07:20,375 --> 00:07:23,440
Don't start saying you don't want to become a grand witch again.

94
00:07:23,805 --> 00:07:25,720
That would make things very difficult for Mama.

95
00:07:26,235 --> 00:07:28,792
Now go study your magic like a proper witch

96
00:07:28,816 --> 00:07:31,225
until Mama gets back. Go on, go on.

97
00:07:31,249 --> 00:07:32,820
Oh, dear me...

98
00:07:36,860 --> 00:07:39,320
No, I don't want to! I don't want to become a grand witch!

99
00:07:40,045 --> 00:07:41,820
Sapphire will be brought here soon.

100
00:07:42,115 --> 00:07:46,100
Oh, I hate this! Poor Sapphire...

101
00:07:48,695 --> 00:07:52,800
I know! I'll sneak out of here and save Sapphire.

102
00:08:59,870 --> 00:09:00,899
To Demon Mountain...

103
00:09:07,687 --> 00:09:08,847
It's Sapphire!

104
00:09:11,700 --> 00:09:14,306
Demon Mountain, Demon Mountain...

105
00:09:14,597 --> 00:09:15,700
Sapphire, don't go!

106
00:09:16,699 --> 00:09:18,099
Whoa, Opal.

107
00:09:18,123 --> 00:09:19,480
What's wrong, Sapphire?

108
00:09:21,386 --> 00:09:22,099
Oh...

109
00:09:22,277 --> 00:09:25,186
Mom made you smell that potion that turns humans into dolls, didn't she?

110
00:09:25,723 --> 00:09:27,026
Poor Sapphire.

111
00:09:29,110 --> 00:09:30,980
Did she put the potion on this flower?

112
00:09:32,908 --> 00:09:34,800
Guess not. Is this flower special to you?

113
00:09:35,780 --> 00:09:36,780
Franz...

114
00:09:37,120 --> 00:09:38,120
Franz?

115
00:09:40,200 --> 00:09:42,639
Prince Franz of Goldland.

116
00:09:43,397 --> 00:09:45,393
My dear Prince Franz.

117
00:09:46,385 --> 00:09:48,126
You love him, don't you?

118
00:09:48,717 --> 00:09:51,060
Then I'll take you to him!

119
00:09:52,255 --> 00:09:53,646
Come on, horsey, follow me.

120
00:09:53,670 --> 00:09:55,033
We're going to Goldland.

121
00:09:55,057 --> 00:09:57,000
I'm sure the prince can save you.

122
00:10:02,849 --> 00:10:05,186
Sapphire isn't here? Nor Hecate?

123
00:10:05,514 --> 00:10:08,000
What on earth have you been doing?!

124
00:10:08,173 --> 00:10:09,253
Now, now, my dear.

125
00:10:09,278 --> 00:10:13,386
We can easily find Sapphire's whereabouts using the magic orb.

126
00:10:16,180 --> 00:10:18,140
Magic orb, magic orb, tell me...

127
00:10:19,320 --> 00:10:23,393
It's Sapphire! She's running around out there. Was my magic spell broken?

128
00:10:24,019 --> 00:10:25,240
That's impossible.

129
00:10:25,380 --> 00:10:26,453
That's right, dear.

130
00:10:26,477 --> 00:10:29,279
If you have time to dawdle, get ready to leave!

131
00:10:29,303 --> 00:10:30,739
Where are we going?

132
00:10:30,763 --> 00:10:33,226
Goldland, of course!

133
00:10:33,319 --> 00:10:36,279
Can't you even see which way Sapphire is going?

134
00:10:36,310 --> 00:10:38,059
And you call yourself the Demon King?

135
00:11:00,619 --> 00:11:03,440
Hey, look! A weird cat came by.

136
00:11:15,006 --> 00:11:17,400
Hey, the cat's dancing!

137
00:11:21,049 --> 00:11:23,580
This cat must have escaped from the circus.

138
00:11:50,239 --> 00:11:52,800
Sapphire, look! This is the Prince's room.

139
00:11:55,320 --> 00:11:56,800
Wait here, you'll meet him soon.

140
00:12:00,979 --> 00:12:01,979
You may come in.

141
00:12:03,709 --> 00:12:05,060
Who is it? What do you want?

142
00:12:07,700 --> 00:12:08,700
Sapphire!

143
00:12:10,335 --> 00:12:11,840
Welcome, Sapphire!

144
00:12:14,389 --> 00:12:16,306
What a wonderful gentleman!

145
00:12:17,329 --> 00:12:18,440
What brings you here today?

146
00:12:19,500 --> 00:12:20,940
What is it? Why are you staying quiet?

147
00:12:21,220 --> 00:12:22,220
What's wrong, Sapphire?

148
00:12:22,999 --> 00:12:25,121
Sapphire, you're acting strange. Are you sick?

149
00:12:25,665 --> 00:12:28,560
With such a wonderful gentleman on our side, I'm relieved!

150
00:12:29,979 --> 00:12:34,001
Prince Franz! An intruder has broken into the castle!

151
00:12:34,025 --> 00:12:35,053
An intruder?

152
00:12:36,939 --> 00:12:37,887
Sapphire is...

153
00:12:38,811 --> 00:12:40,660
I see, so that's what happened!

154
00:12:41,600 --> 00:12:43,321
There's no one suspicious in here!

155
00:12:44,078 --> 00:12:47,300
Please open up! We need to search your room!

156
00:12:47,449 --> 00:12:49,220
Did someone suspicious break in?

157
00:12:49,390 --> 00:12:50,660
Ah, King Chanel!

158
00:12:51,250 --> 00:12:54,140
Alright, go! I'll search Franz's room myself!

159
00:12:54,320 --> 00:12:55,320
Yes, sir!

160
00:12:57,409 --> 00:13:00,780
Franz! It's me, Chanel V! Open up!

161
00:13:01,295 --> 00:13:03,300
Ah! Uncle! I'll open it right now!

162
00:13:20,179 --> 00:13:21,960
Please, come in, Uncle.

163
00:13:23,465 --> 00:13:25,800
If you find anyone suspicious, feel free to throw them out.

164
00:13:32,409 --> 00:13:33,940
Franz, who is this young lady?

165
00:13:35,734 --> 00:13:38,180
A young lady? Take a closer look.

166
00:13:38,625 --> 00:13:40,280
It's a doll my girlfriend gave me.

167
00:13:40,705 --> 00:13:43,760
It's too big for the shelf, so I sat it on the chair.

168
00:13:44,495 --> 00:13:45,560
It's remarkably well made.

169
00:13:51,150 --> 00:13:55,580
A maiden with flaxen hair! I see, so that was it!

170
00:14:06,869 --> 00:14:07,522
Franz!

171
00:14:08,373 --> 00:14:09,780
Franz! Franz!

172
00:14:10,629 --> 00:14:13,320
How rude, Franz! Are you planning to marry that doll or something?!

173
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,160
Marriage?

174
00:14:15,569 --> 00:14:18,993
Come on, pull yourself together, Franz. What do you think of this lady?

175
00:14:22,550 --> 00:14:26,380
Sure, she's no beauty. But she's incredibly rich!

176
00:14:26,735 --> 00:14:27,735
Not this again...

177
00:14:28,279 --> 00:14:31,719
Franz, at least promise to marry this young lady.

178
00:14:31,743 --> 00:14:33,860
She comes with a five-billion-yen dowry!

179
00:14:34,160 --> 00:14:37,666
With that much money, Goldland will manage to get by.

180
00:14:37,973 --> 00:14:38,480
No.

181
00:14:38,635 --> 00:14:39,341
What?!

182
00:14:41,769 --> 00:14:45,780
Marrying for money?! Uncle, I'll choose for myself!

183
00:14:46,091 --> 00:14:49,933
You selfish fool! You might as well just marry this doll!

184
00:14:51,000 --> 00:14:52,979
Dammit! Of course I will! For sure!

185
00:14:53,460 --> 00:14:55,400
Blast it! Is this girl mocking me?!

186
00:14:57,019 --> 00:14:59,045
This time, I'll make him marry this young lady!

187
00:14:59,289 --> 00:15:02,800
If he doesn't say yes by Christmas, I'll kick him out of this castle!

188
00:15:07,559 --> 00:15:09,153
As if I'd ever listen to what Uncle says!

189
00:15:11,019 --> 00:15:12,800
Sapphire, I'll never let you go again.

190
00:15:13,535 --> 00:15:15,640
For your sake, I'd gladly give my life.

191
00:15:25,979 --> 00:15:28,080
Sapphire, what really happened to you?

192
00:15:28,190 --> 00:15:29,580
You look just like a real doll.

193
00:15:54,709 --> 00:15:55,965
Did you hear that?

194
00:15:55,989 --> 00:15:58,086
Now, smash through the roof!

195
00:15:59,329 --> 00:16:03,720
Busting through a roof? Any little imp could do that!

196
00:16:03,915 --> 00:16:05,306
Is there a problem with that?

197
00:16:06,259 --> 00:16:09,112
What a pathetic Demon King. Just because she's a girl,

198
00:16:09,136 --> 00:16:11,724
he can't make Hecate a great witch no matter how many years pass.

199
00:16:11,749 --> 00:16:13,013
But I'm different.

200
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,520
How do I look?

201
00:16:24,653 --> 00:16:28,999
You look beautiful. But what do you plan to do like that?

202
00:16:29,156 --> 00:16:31,980
The scheme is set. Leave it to me.

203
00:16:35,759 --> 00:16:38,812
Welcome. Which kingdom's princess are you?

204
00:16:39,236 --> 00:16:41,460
I am the witch of the Kingdom of Fel.

205
00:16:42,620 --> 00:16:45,879
And I am her master... er, servant, Stoton.

206
00:16:45,903 --> 00:16:48,346
And what brings you to Goldland?

207
00:16:48,371 --> 00:16:49,840
Well, you see...

208
00:16:51,169 --> 00:16:52,960
Stoton, explain it to him.

209
00:16:53,813 --> 00:16:58,678
At the recent martial arts tournament, my lady took one look at Prince Franz

210
00:16:58,703 --> 00:17:00,233
here and fell head over heels.

211
00:17:02,543 --> 00:17:06,599
First, as a token of our friendship, please accept this gift.

212
00:17:08,739 --> 00:17:11,660
Oh dear, it seems the box was a bit too small.

213
00:17:13,299 --> 00:17:16,851
In our country, we pave our roads with diamonds, after all.

214
00:17:16,876 --> 00:17:19,460
W-What? Paving roads with diamonds?!

215
00:17:20,899 --> 00:17:22,625
<i>After all, they were just pebbles to begin with.</i>

216
00:17:23,096 --> 00:17:25,060
<i>So you can have as many as you like.</i>

217
00:17:26,229 --> 00:17:29,285
Well if Prince Franz intends to become engaged to Lady Maju,

218
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:33,200
we will gift you ten thousand tons of gold coins.

219
00:17:33,225 --> 00:17:34,533
Ten thousand tons...

220
00:17:38,059 --> 00:17:42,632
Ten thousand tons, ten thousand tons, ten thousand tons... Ten thousand tons of gold coins...

221
00:17:42,656 --> 00:17:46,646
Lord Channel, so what do you think of this proposal?

222
00:17:46,811 --> 00:17:49,519
Ten thousand tons of gold coins... Ten thousand tons...

223
00:17:49,543 --> 00:17:52,586
Lord Channel, how does that sound?

224
00:18:01,929 --> 00:18:04,965
Of course! Is there any better match than this?

225
00:18:04,989 --> 00:18:07,160
Franz will be thrilled, I'm sure.

226
00:18:07,844 --> 00:18:10,205
Oh, Stoton...

227
00:18:10,229 --> 00:18:14,745
Madame Witch, how wonderful. Now then, may we have a ring as a token of betrothal?

228
00:18:14,769 --> 00:18:18,579
Of course, I'll have one made right away.

229
00:18:18,603 --> 00:18:21,000
Not THAT ring, but something else...

230
00:18:21,869 --> 00:18:23,092
Anything at all!

231
00:18:23,269 --> 00:18:27,685
I hear Prince Franz possesses such a wonderfully charming doll...

232
00:18:27,709 --> 00:18:29,054
Doll...?

233
00:18:31,954 --> 00:18:34,099
A doll for a betrothal? Is that strange?

234
00:18:35,003 --> 00:18:37,379
No, no, it's wonderful, absolutely wonderful!

235
00:18:37,403 --> 00:18:39,840
I'll go fetch it right away. Please wait a moment...

236
00:18:42,849 --> 00:18:45,433
Well, well, looks like things are going smoothly.

237
00:18:46,219 --> 00:18:47,919
Open up! Open it!

238
00:18:48,776 --> 00:18:50,240
Franz, open this door!

239
00:18:50,504 --> 00:18:52,146
Hand over the document! Hand it over!

240
00:18:52,254 --> 00:18:54,540
No way! No matter what happens, I'm never giving it to you!

241
00:18:58,074 --> 00:18:59,700
With this hand, I can make it work!

242
00:19:00,459 --> 00:19:03,860
Zubarasha! Akorojissho!

243
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:13,506
What's that?

244
00:19:15,926 --> 00:19:17,300
I don't care! Break down the door!

245
00:19:26,269 --> 00:19:28,393
Franz! Franz! Where are you hiding?

246
00:19:29,760 --> 00:19:30,426
There!

247
00:19:32,609 --> 00:19:34,800
Franz is in the courtyard! Search the courtyard!

248
00:19:36,779 --> 00:19:38,380
Sapphire! Hurry! Hurry!

249
00:19:38,880 --> 00:19:40,033
I know! Let's hide over there!

250
00:19:47,089 --> 00:19:52,306
This is a chapel. I'm the demon king's daughter, so I can't go near it.

251
00:19:59,799 --> 00:20:01,945
Sapphire, I'll never let anyone have you.

252
00:20:01,969 --> 00:20:05,960
If anyone comes to capture you, even Chanel V, they'll pay for it.

253
00:20:06,569 --> 00:20:07,569
Did you find Prince Franz?

254
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:08,360
He's not here!

255
00:20:08,694 --> 00:20:09,913
Alright, search along the way!

256
00:20:12,799 --> 00:20:15,600
Lady Maju! Lady Maju! For the betrothal... must it be a doll?

257
00:20:16,319 --> 00:20:20,380
Wait, Lady Maju isn't even here! Huh? The jewels...? What is going on here?

258
00:20:29,629 --> 00:20:31,440
Things aren't going well at all.

259
00:20:31,834 --> 00:20:33,833
We still have another way. Look at this.

260
00:20:33,857 --> 00:20:36,800
 It's a potion that turns living things to stone for half a day.

261
00:20:37,589 --> 00:20:40,800
That river flows into the castle and provides their drinking water.

262
00:20:45,653 --> 00:20:47,160
Just watch.

263
00:20:55,569 --> 00:20:56,680
The fish turned to stone!

264
00:20:57,529 --> 00:21:00,880
Flow on, river, and turn everything into stone!

265
00:21:33,059 --> 00:21:37,841
I have no idea what's going on. The witch is gone, jewels turn to stone...

266
00:21:39,046 --> 00:21:40,940
Can we still find Franz?

267
00:21:41,209 --> 00:21:44,800
Hey, what are you dawdling for? What are you doing here?

268
00:21:47,969 --> 00:21:49,820
Stone! They've turned to stone!

269
00:21:51,579 --> 00:21:54,027
It's a demon! A demon's doing!

270
00:21:54,051 --> 00:21:56,746
Is anyone there? Somebody!

271
00:21:57,599 --> 00:21:59,893
Hey, someone! Is anyone there?

272
00:22:03,439 --> 00:22:05,780
Someone, please come! Anybody!

273
00:22:06,189 --> 00:22:08,533
No one's here! There's nobody in this castle!

274
00:22:08,666 --> 00:22:10,986
Everyone has turned to stone!

275
00:22:24,383 --> 00:22:25,380
It's that man!

276
00:22:30,049 --> 00:22:32,960
There must be a demon in this castle!

277
00:22:37,329 --> 00:22:39,820
Sapphire, something seems off. Keep an eye out.

278
00:22:40,720 --> 00:22:43,240
Franz! No! Don't go out now!

279
00:22:43,280 --> 00:22:45,300
Oh no! He went out!

280
00:22:47,549 --> 00:22:49,320
It's as if there isn't a single living soul here.

281
00:22:51,160 --> 00:22:52,160
It's Uncle!

282
00:22:53,440 --> 00:22:54,060
This is strange!

283
00:22:54,264 --> 00:22:55,358
He's not moving at all!

284
00:22:55,480 --> 00:22:56,013
Alright!

285
00:23:00,529 --> 00:23:03,540
Stone! He's turned to stone! It's the work of a demon!

286
00:23:10,760 --> 00:23:11,760
It's a demon!

287
00:23:11,869 --> 00:23:13,846
Brat! Hand over Sapphire!

288
00:23:14,220 --> 00:23:15,220
What did you say?

289
00:23:15,999 --> 00:23:19,040
Hand Sapphire over and do as you're told, or you'll regret it!

290
00:23:19,214 --> 00:23:21,453
I'll never hand her over, even if you kill me! Here I come!

291
00:23:21,845 --> 00:23:24,438
Zubarasha!

292
00:23:24,959 --> 00:23:26,759
Sore, kaze yo!

293
00:23:38,359 --> 00:23:39,820
Is Sapphire in there?

294
00:23:40,149 --> 00:23:42,720
I will never give Sapphire to you!

295
00:23:43,778 --> 00:23:44,866
It's a chapel!

296
00:23:45,026 --> 00:23:46,420
How pathetic!

297
00:23:47,274 --> 00:23:49,886
Zubarasha!

298
00:23:56,103 --> 00:23:56,800
Water!

299
00:23:59,153 --> 00:23:59,639
Water!

300
00:23:59,720 --> 00:24:00,720
You've come to.

301
00:24:01,640 --> 00:24:02,260
Franz!

302
00:24:02,280 --> 00:24:03,280
Sapphire!

303
00:24:06,938 --> 00:24:08,158
Sapphire!

304
00:24:08,411 --> 00:24:09,858
Franz!

305
00:24:10,898 --> 00:24:11,678
Franz!

306
00:24:11,771 --> 00:24:12,691
Sapphire!

307
00:24:17,159 --> 00:24:20,080
Hang in there, Sapphire! Franz!

308
00:24:23,554 --> 00:24:25,800
This will make them burst out along with the water!

309
00:24:27,820 --> 00:24:29,073
Sapphire!

310
00:24:29,191 --> 00:24:30,649
Franz!

311
00:24:30,940 --> 00:24:31,820
Sapphire!

312
00:24:31,940 --> 00:24:32,606
Hold on!

313
00:24:33,474 --> 00:24:35,555
Fran—Franz

314
00:24:35,580 --> 00:24:36,800
Sapphire!

315
00:24:38,113 --> 00:24:39,113
Franz!

316
00:24:39,500 --> 00:24:40,780
Sapphire!

317
00:24:46,860 --> 00:24:48,920
Sapphire! Sapphire!

318
00:24:50,609 --> 00:24:54,453
Sapphire! I'll save you... I promise!

